================================================================================
WINDOWS DISTRIBUTION (MinGit)
================================================================================

Windows wheels use MinGit from the Git for Windows project:
  https://github.com/git-for-windows/git

Source code for Git for Windows is available at:
  https://github.com/git-for-windows/git

MinGit bundles additional third-party components with their own licenses.
These licenses are included in the wheel at:
  git_bin/git/mingw64/share/licenses/
  git_bin/git/usr/share/licenses/

Bundled components include (but are not limited to):
- OpenSSL (Apache 2.0) - https://www.openssl.org
- curl (MIT-like) - https://curl.se
- libssh2 (BSD) - https://libssh2.org
- zlib (zlib license) - https://zlib.net
- pcre2 (BSD) - https://pcre2project.github.io/pcre2/
- nghttp2 (MIT) - https://nghttp2.org
- brotli (MIT) - https://github.com/google/brotli
- zstd (BSD) - https://github.com/facebook/zstd
- libiconv (LGPL) - https://www.gnu.org/software/libiconv/
- gettext (LGPL) - https://www.gnu.org/software/gettext/
- Git Credential Manager (MIT) - https://github.com/git-ecosystem/git-credential-manager

